# Description           :       This is the main script that gets triggered when CustAcctInquiry is called
# Input                 :       Request XML
# Output                :       Response XML
# Called Script         :       None
# Calling Script        :       Common_CreateRepos.scr, CustAcctInquiry_FetchInputDetails.scr, 
#				CustAcctInquiry_ValidateInputDetails.scr, CustAcctInquiry_FetchAccountDetails.scr,
#				CustAcctInquiry_FetchCustomerDetails.scr,CustAcctInquiry_SendResponse.scr,
#				CustAcctInquiry_ErrorList.scr,Common_ErrorExit.scr
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----           -----           --------          ----------------        ---------
